### Test the Chat Endpoint
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "Hi, my favorite number is 42."
}

# Look at the end of the stream response for [SESSION_ID]<your-uuid>

### Test Chat 2 (Tests the memory)
# Replace <your-uuid> with the actual ID returned from the first request
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "session_id": "<your-uuid>",
  "message": "What is my favorite number?"
}


